      "content": "It's not even about safety anymore. There's nothing left to save. My family is gone, the supplies are gone... even if we survived the siege, what's left? Everything is just empty. It feels like the only thing I can actually control right now is how this ends. I just want it to be quiet. I just want the noise to stop before they get in here.",
