      "content": "It's just... the way they say they'll do it to people. It won't be quick. It'll be so much worse than the hunger. Sometimes I think it would be more dignified to just... decide it for myself. To leave with some kind of peace instead of being taken like animals. Don't you think there's a certain kind of mercy in that? To choose your own exit before the chaos starts?",
